  "description": "RIZTEA crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21. Reported CIF formula moiety: C106 H114 N9 O4 Si2 Yb3,1.5(C7 H8). From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 2 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 2 O neighbors; Yb3 (Yb) has 4 O neighbors; Yb4 (Yb) has 2 O neighbors; Yb5 (Yb) has 2 O neighbors; Yb6 (Yb) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a chain with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.612-3.647 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 106.51-109.56°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C106H114N9O4Si2Yb3·1.5(C7H8).",
